00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
You told your AI assistant how your shop works.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
A fresh conversation may be missing a decision you already made.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
A skill guides your AI; the connected memory tool stores the notes.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Ask it to save a decision. It keeps a note on your computer.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:37,000
The assistant can search saved notes, then check what is still true.

6
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The earlier decision can inform the next piece of work.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Use the setup guide for Claude Code or Codex. Saving stays your choice.

8
00:00:53,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Explore the free, open-source collection and its setup guide.
